<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1444052013"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:28.307"><div begin="34.758" end="59.510" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="34.758" end="38.506" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.758" end="35.264">你</span><span begin="35.264" end="35.523">眼</span><span begin="35.523" end="35.933">盖</span><span begin="35.933" end="37.210">脱了色</span><span begin="37.210" end="38.506">彩</span></p><p begin="41.395" end="45.449" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.395" end="41.920">颈</span><span begin="41.920" end="42.117">巾</span><span begin="42.117" end="42.563">即</span><span begin="42.563" end="43.012">将</span><span begin="43.012" end="43.478">松</span><span begin="43.478" end="44.439">脱下</span><span begin="44.439" end="45.449">来</span></p><p begin="48.080" end="52.883" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.080" end="48.531">我</span><span begin="48.531" end="48.765">在</span><span begin="48.765" end="49.691">探听</span> <span begin="49.691" end="50.586">谁像</span><span begin="50.586" end="51.843">亲你在</span><span begin="51.843" end="52.173">怀</span><span begin="52.173" end="52.883">内</span></p><p begin="53.066" end="59.510" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.066" end="53.558">可</span><span begin="53.558" end="53.869">是</span><span begin="53.869" end="55.474">你</span> <span begin="56.320" end="57.242">心不会</span><span begin="57.242" end="57.824">装</span><span begin="57.824" end="59.510">载</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.420" end="1:16.148" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:01.420" end="1:06.131" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.420" end="1:01.968">而</span><span begin="1:01.968" end="1:02.350">我</span><span begin="1:02.350" end="1:03.056">知</span> <span begin="1:03.056" end="1:03.930">深</span><span begin="1:03.930" end="1:04.678">受其</span><span begin="1:04.678" end="1:06.131">害</span></p><p begin="1:08.054" end="1:16.148" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.054" end="1:08.962">仍然</sp